.TH tkutltools n 0.1 tkutils
.SH tkutils::tkutltools
.PP
Umbrella for the tablelist extension family. Requiring this one package pulls in
\fBtablelist\fR plus all \fBtkutl*\fR helpers and the shared
\fBtclutils::tunum\fR number backend.
.PP
It is kept separate from the main \fBtkutils\fR umbrella, which loads only
pure\-Tk/tclutils modules; \fBtablelist\fR is external, so require this only
where tablelist is present.
.SS Loads
.CS
tkutils::tkutlsort   tkutils::tkutlfmt    tkutils::tkutlclip
tkutils::tkutlfooter tkutils::tkutlfind   tkutils::tkutlstate
tkutils::tkutltree   tclutils::tunum
.CE
.SS Usage
.CS
package require tkutils::tkutltools
.CE
.SH "SEE ALSO"
tkutils::tkutlsort(n), tkutils::tkutlfmt(n), tkutils::tkutlclip(n),
tkutils::tkutlfooter(n), tkutils::tkutlfind(n), tkutils::tkutlstate(n),
tkutils::tkutltree(n), tclutils::tunum(n)
.SH KEYWORDS
tablelist, umbrella, bundle
